Use dev branch:
git clone --branch dev https://github.com/jussi-kupari/sccamel

(install micromamba/miniconda if not installed already)

Then run the following lines one-by-one in the terminal:

cd sccamel
micromamba create --prefix ./env
micromamba activate ./env
micromamba install python=3.8 pip ipykernel entrypoints
pip install .
pip install torchvision anndata scanpy
